s still kind to anyone. Her weak point is never doubting someone, and her special ability is always going at her own pace."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1254"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aaea831efee0077da846643bb9d92979c4043ae2793cc1a498a37e68afc7470a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4bd554b34c195635b58aedb837e35dcb2ae0c8d2045c795df966e49a8f058ba.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"折笠 富美子","creatorId":"vndb:s1240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1240","name":"折笠富美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24086","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1255","characterName":"大河内 マリア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1255"},"originalCharacterName":"大河内 マリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maria is a sophomore, and it is surprising she was able to enter Koutenrin since she is not from a rich or famous family, and pushed away from her parents to enter the school. She is a very energetic and loud person, and also a bit of a trouble-maker, as her forceful attitude leads to fights. Her weak point is she is sensitive about her physical features, and her special ability is being mischievous."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1255"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/318dcd25a48c5b1cfbeedbff9f272974b936098eeb0